   1366  fe9c							; solid. A door strip is solid until the key is held, then the touch
   1367  fe9c							; destroys it (EnemyDeadMask b3) and the walk passes (Phase 5).
   1368  fe9c							; Kill follows the VISIBLE right-half block only (async ruling 2026-10-14 —
   1369  fe9c							; no left mirror). The retired vcrunch kill test is gone.
