   1402  fec2							; (guard: verify_build check_moth_tramp). bank2's `sta $1FF8` half never
   1403  fec2							; runs (entry always arrives from bank0); the `jmp MothRoutine` half at
   1404  fec2							; $FEF3 runs after bank0's switch. Assembles to the same 6 bytes as
   1405  fec2							; kernel's `sta $1FF8 / jmp $F110` — operand drift fails the guard.
   1406  fec2							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
